# Factory Review Skill

When the user asks for a review, cross review, adversarial review, stress test, red team, second opinion, fact check, or sanity check:

1. Read `skills/factory-review/SKILL.md`
2. Identify what's being reviewed (content, spec, code, claims)
3. Pick the matching review mode and present the appropriate prompt
4. Help the user send it to a different AI model for review
5. After review: you are the editor-in-chief — assess which feedback is valid vs noise
